<title>JAPAN: Japan external reserves $222.305 bln at end-June.</title>
<headline>Japan external reserves $222.305 bln at end-June.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's external reserves rose $544 million from a month earlier to a record $222.305 billion at the end of June, the Finance Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reserves at the end of May were $221.761 billion, which was up $1.865 billion from the previous month.</p>
<p>Figures may not tally due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
